-- the quantized triads close: Σ_e′ K_0e′ = K_00 + 3K_01 = 0 (the four edges are equivalent under the rotations), so
-- the angle between two edges' triads, K_01/K_00, is −1/3, the classical tetrahedral angle; K_00 = −(3/32)·3^{1/4}(1 − 5^{1/4})²
tet-triad-closure-of : VW → List (List Side) → List PRad
tet-triad-closure-of w ss = tet-half-trace (terms-append (k-terms 0 0 tet-ds tet-ts w (sides-nth 0 ss) (sides-nth 0 ss)) (terms-scale (sq-nat 3) (k-terms 0 1 tet-ds tet-ts w (sides-nth 0 ss) (sides-nth 1 ss))))
